om/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T08:04:30-07:00","id":1083976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/821719-nightmares-dreamscapes-incursions-from-the-primordial-dream?p=1083960#post1083960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. Would <b>Colleges</b> make sense to break out into a separate topic for discussion?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yep, I'd say so. I'd connect it to the &quot;Justifications&quot; thread too. Colleges solves the name problem","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T10:01:06-07:00","id":1084032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/821719-nightmares-dreamscapes-incursions-from-the-primordial-dream?p=1083974#post1083974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Guess so. This thread was meant to include Primordial Dream stuff, though I'm totally fine with it becoming the &quot;Beast Homebrew&quot;. Still, I think trying to keep it clear and organized in entries without many discussions between each other is probably for the best</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/821719-nightmares-dreamscapes-incursions-from-the-primordial-dream?p=1083976#post1083976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep, I'd say so. I'd connect it to the &quot;Justifications&quot; thread too. Colleges solves the name problem</div> </div> </div> </div>Started the thread. So far, it is just the ideas I already listed. Hoping discussion with elaborate things further, and establish a template for people to come up with Colleges easily.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-27T08:08:15-07:00","id":1084487,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Gram</b></u><br /> <b>Base Item</b>: Sword, Long (Damage 3, Initiative -2, Minimum Strength 2, Size 3)<br /> [Desc. - based on the sword from the <i>Volsunga Saga</i>.]<br /> <b>Legend</b>: Coveted - The sword evokes a desire to possess it far beyond its own merits. Displaying the weapon to envious onlookers restores a point of the wielder's Willpower. When powerful forces attempt to steal or extort it from its owner, the bearer fully restores their own Willpower.<br /> <b>Powers</b>:<ul><li><b>Ignore Armor</b> - No form of Armor or Durability applies to attacks made by the weapon. Neither the finest steel, nor thickest dragonscale impedes the edge of the blade.</li> <li><b>Unbreakable</b> - Damage and powers from less than godly sources (Ephemerals of Rank 6 or greater, Incarnate Beasts, Archmasters, other Mythic weapons, etc.) cannot bypass the item's Durability.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 04-28-2017, 08:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join 